1.1.0 2026-10-29
  - Added: participants sub-9 to sub-14 (second study of the release, unilateral condition only; Zenodo
    10.5281/zenodo.17940098) with their recordings and 54 BrainVision source files; sub-1 to sub-8 come from the
    same recordings (source files byte-identical in both versions of the release).
  - Corrected, per the dataset authors' review (NeuroTechX/moabb#1333): executed, not imagined, movements. Task
    label reaching (was imagery) in all file names and TaskName; TaskDescription and Instructions describe the trial
    protocol (rest >= 5 s, movement onset at 0 s, self-paced execution); HED of the events tags agent actions (was
    Sensory-event); the imagery CogAtlasID is removed.
  - Corrected: events keep correct trials only (error trials, marker S3, and additional trials, S27, removed);
    added rest events. Counts: 1,662 unilateral, 959 bilateral, 2,542 rest.
  - Corrected: participants.tsv age of sub-1 to sub-8 (was the cohort mean 25.5 for everyone) and sex and hand
    (were n/a), from the release's metadata. Added columns study and source_id; published columns kept.
  - Kept: the 1.0.x scans tables (task-imagery file names, acquisition times) under sourcedata/sub-<N>/ses-0/.
  - README: the published text is kept; a new section "Version 1.1.0 additions and corrections" follows it.
  - dataset_description.json: author Kartik Chari, release version 2 in ReferencesAndLinks and SourceDatasets.

1.0.1 2026-10-16
  - sourcedata: added the data (.eeg) and marker (.vmrk) file each header names (DataFile, MarkerFile) for the 49 BrainVision headers (<condition>/<participant>/*.vhdr) already in sourcedata/
    (98 files, 3,346,539,331 bytes), unchanged from the Zenodo release 10.5281/zenodo.10229480 (members EEG_dataset/EEG/... of the archive EEG_dataset.zip).
    The MOABB loader (moabb.datasets.Kueper2024) needs them to read a recording from this deposit.
    No existing file changed; the BIDS tree is unchanged.
